	"status_note": "Source (report 0026, Q17, rule 2): photo 2 (2020-06-06) shows the hall from across Hạ Long (the pyramid roof with its light hips, the white pediment of the porch, the fence with blue posts; trees hide the walls of the front), and photo 1 (2021-01-30) shows the roof, the porch and two sides from a drone. The sizes come from the photos of 2014 (photos 0, 3 and 4) and of 2020 and 2021. The plinth, the hips, the depth of the porch and the sill of the arched windows are estimates (no source). The near level is not built: the factory stopped at each order of the near level (HTTP 503), so it needs a build with more memory (the job \"Models of World\")."
